        "kind": "predict",
        "blocks": [],
        "lead": [
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Convert to base units first. Then find EI, and PL³ divided by three times EI."
          }
        ],
        "reveal": [
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "You worked in base units: EI = 400,000 N·m² and PL³ = 24,000 N·m³, so δ = 24,000 ÷ 1,200,000 = 0.02 m, which is 20 mm."
          }
